WEBVTT

00:00:02.109 --> 00:00:05.279
Once, when many planets
intermingled and

00:00:05.613 --> 00:00:08.716
the boundary between man
and god was vague...

00:00:09.316 --> 00:00:14.221
There was a tale of a particular family.
A tale of love and rebirth.

00:00:17.892 --> 00:00:27.201
Sometimes I think things over.
It helps to cheer me up.

00:00:34.942 --> 00:00:37.678
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:00:40.848 --> 00:00:44.585
This place has always
meant everything to me.

00:00:46.520 --> 00:00:49.890
It rains so beautifully here.

00:00:50.190 --> 00:00:55.329
I can dance like the wind.

00:00:57.798 --> 00:01:00.834
Even now, I'm having fun.

00:01:03.270 --> 00:01:06.674
I have a better sense of
rhythm than you'd think.

00:01:07.141 --> 00:01:12.346
It felt as though every time
I heard a certain someone's voice,

00:01:12.780 --> 00:01:22.756
I would think back to how
I grew up surrounded by laughter.

00:01:23.090 --> 00:01:28.762
Yes, anywhere would have
done as a place to call home.

00:01:28.762 --> 00:01:34.335
Farewell, sunshine!
The night rises up invitingly.

00:01:34.501 --> 00:01:39.607
It's okay, this world moves
in a way that will connect us.

00:01:39.807 --> 00:01:46.313
So that we can all smile
together once again.

00:02:09.837 --> 00:02:12.806
Father... Mother...

00:02:37.131 --> 00:02:41.635
A Story Where Two Plan
and One Worries

00:02:41.635 --> 00:02:43.103
Chapter 16: The
Past (6)/ Yakushimaru

00:02:54.748 --> 00:02:55.683
You okay?

00:03:00.487 --> 00:03:01.422
I'm back.

00:03:01.555 --> 00:03:03.691
Welcome home—

00:03:11.498 --> 00:03:13.534
What on earth happened?

00:03:14.068 --> 00:03:15.135
| found him.

00:03:18.605 --> 00:03:21.275
You said you liked children.

00:03:21.975 --> 00:03:24.178
I'm going to make him our son.

00:03:29.683 --> 00:03:31.118
But...

00:03:34.154 --> 00:03:35.055
Don't worry.

00:04:03.117 --> 00:04:08.989
Myoue

00:04:26.406 --> 00:04:27.741
This one's special.

00:04:31.345 --> 00:04:32.379
Feed it to him.

00:04:41.755 --> 00:04:46.093
Koto, that is not for the living.

00:04:54.301 --> 00:04:55.836
Don't swallow it by mistake.

00:05:27.234 --> 00:05:30.137
From now on, he's our son.

00:05:50.791 --> 00:05:51.992
| see you're awake.

00:05:54.328 --> 00:05:55.295
Who are you?

00:06:00.367 --> 00:06:01.835
What did you do to me?

00:06:05.272 --> 00:06:08.275
He's the priest of the
monster temple, right?

00:06:08.609 --> 00:06:10.244
What did you do to me?

00:06:10.410 --> 00:06:11.845
Last night, I...

00:06:12.179 --> 00:06:13.280
You died.

00:06:15.015 --> 00:06:16.483
That's why I brought you here.

00:06:18.085 --> 00:06:19.286
Is there a problem?

00:06:21.054 --> 00:06:22.489
What are you saying?

00:06:26.860 --> 00:06:30.130
You were dead, so I brought
you here and revived you.

00:06:30.831 --> 00:06:34.234
Your home is gone, so from
now on, you can live with us.

00:06:34.835 --> 00:06:39.806
And if possible, I'd like you
to play the role of our son.

00:06:50.050 --> 00:06:51.151
Not a bad deal, is it?

00:07:36.496 --> 00:07:38.198
What is this?

00:07:45.939 --> 00:07:46.707
Stop it!

00:07:47.307 --> 00:07:48.642
What is this?

00:07:48.642 --> 00:07:50.544
What happened to my body?

00:07:55.048 --> 00:07:56.683
You just won't die, that's all.

00:08:04.257 --> 00:08:06.994
This can't be happening...

00:08:09.062 --> 00:08:11.765
No... I...

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:15.035
I'm just a monster, then!

00:08:21.408 --> 00:08:23.076
Don't get so down.

00:08:25.212 --> 00:08:27.080
It'll just take some getting used to.

00:08:48.869 --> 00:08:50.337
Let's get you something to eat.

00:08:55.842 --> 00:08:58.445
Pretty soon,
you'll be glad you're alive.

00:08:59.279 --> 00:09:01.081
Koto's cooking is delicious.

00:10:41.381 --> 00:10:45.085
Brother Sister

00:11:20.020 --> 00:11:22.022
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:11:22.022 --> 00:11:23.490
Chapter 17: The
Present (11)/ Siblings

00:11:27.494 --> 00:11:28.762
It's pretty funny, isn't it?

00:11:30.430 --> 00:11:33.300
It all ended up like the priest said.

00:11:38.638 --> 00:11:40.874
| guess I'm the only one laughing.

00:11:42.576 --> 00:11:44.744
Well, I won't laugh.

00:11:49.649 --> 00:11:54.788
Our mother had a mirror just like yours.

00:11:56.156 --> 00:11:58.024
Where'd you get it?

00:11:58.491 --> 00:11:59.326
Borrowed it.

00:11:59.326 --> 00:12:00.360
Without permission.

00:12:01.728 --> 00:12:03.263
It's actually my dad's.

00:12:04.698 --> 00:12:07.100
| really wanted it, but he
wouldn't give it to me.

00:12:09.135 --> 00:12:13.006
| wanted to have something that
would connect me to my mother.

00:12:16.576 --> 00:12:19.446
It's not fair that Sensei
gets her all to himself.

00:12:24.150 --> 00:12:28.321
| always called my dad "Sensei"...

00:12:28.989 --> 00:12:30.824
It's a habit that's hard to break.

00:12:36.863 --> 00:12:37.597
| see.

00:12:39.566 --> 00:12:40.634
Want to see his face?

00:12:41.167 --> 00:12:41.568
Look!

00:12:42.702 --> 00:12:44.371
Isn't he cool?

00:12:46.306 --> 00:12:49.309
The face is similar.
So's the color of the eyes.

00:12:50.277 --> 00:12:52.679
But the age difference is too great.

00:12:52.812 --> 00:12:53.747
He's too young.

00:12:54.381 --> 00:12:58.318
Come to think of it, he hasn't
changed for as long as I've known him.

00:12:58.818 --> 00:13:00.687
Hey, do you have any pictures of Mom?

00:13:02.589 --> 00:13:05.692
Koto

00:13:05.692 --> 00:13:07.127
She's really pretty!

00:13:07.827 --> 00:13:11.531
So that picture in
Yase's house was Mom?

00:13:12.032 --> 00:13:14.267
Her house is crazy.

00:13:16.202 --> 00:13:18.305
Koto

00:13:19.172 --> 00:13:20.307
It's kind of amazing.

00:13:20.674 --> 00:13:23.510
| didn't realize that this
was Mom at all!

00:13:30.350 --> 00:13:31.618
Yase and Kurama-san?

00:13:31.618 --> 00:13:33.420
Kurama Yase

00:13:37.691 --> 00:13:38.358
Listen.

00:13:39.326 --> 00:13:42.829
Those two are trying to take
advantage of you. Be careful.

00:13:44.998 --> 00:13:46.433
Especially Kurama.

00:13:49.235 --> 00:13:52.038
| can't have anything
happening to you.

00:13:55.075 --> 00:13:59.045
I guess I'm no different in that sense.

00:14:00.413 --> 00:14:01.848
It's fine.

00:14:02.115 --> 00:14:03.249
I'm strong.

00:14:03.483 --> 00:14:04.351
You think, huh?

00:14:06.119 --> 00:14:10.056
And I haven't decided to kill you yet.

00:14:22.469 --> 00:14:25.638
There's no doubt about it.
She's our little sister!

00:14:28.141 --> 00:14:33.246
Whether she is or not,
it's certainly worth testing.

00:14:33.847 --> 00:14:34.714
Test what?

00:14:35.315 --> 00:14:39.586
Why do you think the things
she destroys don't regenerate?

00:14:41.221 --> 00:14:42.655
Her weapon...

00:14:43.089 --> 00:14:44.724
Aratama, was it?

00:14:45.992 --> 00:14:50.730
Shouko-kun tells me that it
creates the same kind of power

00:14:50.730 --> 00:14:54.100
that this place does when
something is recreated.

00:14:54.667 --> 00:14:56.770
Perhaps it's similar to a magnet.

00:14:57.370 --> 00:14:59.606
When two forces of the
same pole collide,

00:14:59.873 --> 00:15:02.542
they repel and knock each other away.

00:15:04.711 --> 00:15:08.481
But when different poles
attract and bind one another,

00:15:08.782 --> 00:15:12.485
the more powerful their magnetic force,
the stronger the binding.

00:15:18.391 --> 00:15:22.695
| understand that I don't understand
what you're telling me, if nothing else.

00:15:24.397 --> 00:15:25.999
| want to propose an experiment,

00:15:26.433 --> 00:15:29.736
to investigate these coincidences

00:15:30.236 --> 00:15:33.339
and all my hypotheses and theories.

00:15:35.008 --> 00:15:38.111
| think it's time to go fishing again.
It's been a while.

00:15:40.180 --> 00:15:41.181
That's...

00:15:44.951 --> 00:15:46.853
If it all works,

00:15:47.153 --> 00:15:49.556
your beloved mother will return

00:15:49.956 --> 00:15:52.559
and I will open the door out of this place.

00:15:56.262 --> 00:15:58.198
I'm not sure it'll be that easy.

00:15:58.631 --> 00:16:01.067
The first step is to try...

00:16:01.701 --> 00:16:02.769
Correct?

00:16:07.507 --> 00:16:09.843
Looks like this will be quite
the lively festival.

00:16:21.988 --> 00:16:23.990
Ky OuUSsS O UGI G A

00:16:23.990 --> 00:16:25.458
Chapter 18: The
Present (12)/ Festival

00:16:26.559 --> 00:16:32.065
We are selling talismans warding against evil.
We will not sell them tomorrow.

00:16:32.065 --> 00:16:39.339
They are available tonight only.
Faithful guest, take one and go home.

00:16:39.606 --> 00:16:42.642
Light one candle as an offering.

00:16:42.642 --> 00:16:45.512
Will you take one candle?

00:16:49.282 --> 00:16:52.285
If you're stingy with your offerings,
your prayers won't be answered.

00:16:52.552 --> 00:16:55.955
They say money can
buy you out of hell.

00:16:56.789 --> 00:16:59.092
So we're in hell.

00:16:59.325 --> 00:17:01.194
What? You didn't know that?

00:17:03.796 --> 00:17:05.798
You're horrible, Koto.

00:17:06.199 --> 00:17:07.467
There's a demon here.

00:17:07.800 --> 00:17:08.701
And a buddha, too.

00:17:11.471 --> 00:17:12.405
Yase!

00:17:13.273 --> 00:17:13.973
Koto!

00:17:14.240 --> 00:17:15.942
| didn't think I'd find you here.

00:17:15.942 --> 00:17:17.210
You were looking for me?

00:17:17.210 --> 00:17:18.411
But now I've caught you.

00:17:18.411 --> 00:17:19.279
What's up?

00:17:19.445 --> 00:17:20.680
What did I just say?

00:17:21.014 --> 00:17:22.749
I've come to get you.

00:17:23.583 --> 00:17:24.918
What are you talking about?

00:17:24.918 --> 00:17:27.253
Let's begin the festival entertainment!

00:17:27.387 --> 00:17:28.588
And you're the star!

00:17:30.189 --> 00:17:30.790
Koto!

00:17:38.331 --> 00:17:39.699
Huh?!

00:17:39.699 --> 00:17:41.901
Welcome to the Council of Three.

00:17:41.901 --> 00:17:43.069
We greet you.

00:17:43.536 --> 00:17:45.538
What do you think
you're doing, you two?

00:17:45.838 --> 00:17:48.007
You said once, did you not,

00:17:48.775 --> 00:17:51.978
that if we needed your help,
you would give it.

00:17:52.579 --> 00:17:53.079
Yes.

00:17:53.413 --> 00:17:58.017
Would you be willing to participate
in a small experiment?

00:17:58.351 --> 00:17:59.719
Wait a minute!

00:17:59.719 --> 00:18:01.888
We never discussed this!

00:18:01.888 --> 00:18:03.122
I've heard nothing about this!

00:18:03.122 --> 00:18:04.524
What about the rules?

00:18:04.724 --> 00:18:07.594
You've broken the rules
SO many times,

00:18:07.827 --> 00:18:10.630
and now you're telling us
to follow them, Myoue?

00:18:11.331 --> 00:18:12.298
That's right.

00:18:12.298 --> 00:18:13.399
Know your place.

00:18:15.335 --> 00:18:17.604
I'm not sure I get what's going on.

00:18:17.870 --> 00:18:19.505
What do you want me to do?

00:18:19.906 --> 00:18:21.107
It's simple.

00:18:21.441 --> 00:18:24.777
Just play with him for a bit.

00:18:30.516 --> 00:18:34.520
What good is a
child with no purpose?

00:18:37.957 --> 00:18:41.561
Thus we have placed our hopes
in your childlike potential.

00:18:42.495 --> 00:18:44.197
This is one hard
game they're playing.

00:18:44.197 --> 00:18:46.499
I'm sure she'd love to go
out fighting Bishamaru.

00:18:47.367 --> 00:18:49.035
Goodbye, Koto.

00:18:50.536 --> 00:18:51.104
Stop it!

00:18:51.571 --> 00:18:53.339
| haven't agreed to this.

00:18:53.740 --> 00:18:55.875
| refuse to accept this
as the Council's decision.

00:18:56.275 --> 00:18:59.712
Obey the "first" and
the rules, Kurama!

00:19:03.783 --> 00:19:05.618
This is an official examination.

00:19:06.052 --> 00:19:08.121
You understand that, don't you?

00:19:08.588 --> 00:19:12.659
<i>You want to see Mom, 100,
don't you, Oedipus?</i>

00:19:13.459 --> 00:19:14.193
Mom?

00:19:14.460 --> 00:19:16.963
| was getting so tired of waiting.

00:19:17.230 --> 00:19:19.866
Perhaps I was right,
and taking action ourselves

00:19:19.866 --> 00:19:21.300
is the quickest way to bring

00:19:21.300 --> 00:19:22.468
A: Sis! Un: We're stuck
in here. about the reunion.

00:19:22.635 --> 00:19:25.571
You understand, don't you, Koto?

00:19:31.010 --> 00:19:32.979
This is all moving awfully fast.

00:19:33.279 --> 00:19:35.448
Your parents will cry if
they see you squabble.

00:19:36.616 --> 00:19:38.017
It's strange.

00:19:38.551 --> 00:19:42.622
You all want to see
your mom and dad again...

00:19:43.756 --> 00:19:48.161
I'm the same.
| want to see Mom, too.

00:19:48.494 --> 00:19:49.495
No! Don't!

00:19:51.297 --> 00:19:52.899
Some men don't know when to stop.

00:19:59.806 --> 00:20:00.306
Damn it.

00:20:01.474 --> 00:20:04.644
Don't get in my way, monster.

00:20:05.912 --> 00:20:10.483
And what the hell do you
think you're doing, human?

00:20:11.517 --> 00:20:14.020
Y'know, you guys have been
really good to me.

00:20:14.153 --> 00:20:16.022
You don't need to take hostages.

00:20:16.989 --> 00:20:18.124
But I'll play along.

00:20:18.324 --> 00:20:19.559
| promised, after all.

00:20:20.593 --> 00:20:26.766
Though I think it's wrong to force
all your hopes on a child, monk.

00:20:26.766 --> 00:20:29.168
We've been betrayed so
many times by adults.

00:20:32.772 --> 00:20:34.173
We've both had bad luck, then.

00:20:40.880 --> 00:20:41.981
Wait, damn it!

00:20:41.981 --> 00:20:44.684
You look like an idiot,
getting so angry.

00:20:44.684 --> 00:20:47.487
I'll shut you up right now, demon!

00:20:50.990 --> 00:20:52.525
That's quite a case of sibling rivalry.

00:20:55.962 --> 00:20:57.296
A: Why can't she destroy it?
Un: They're cheating.

00:20:57.296 --> 00:20:57.864
A: Cheating isn't fair!!
Un: They're cheating.

00:20:58.464 --> 00:21:00.700
Look at you now, Princess.

00:21:02.401 --> 00:21:06.205
You useless heir!

00:21:07.540 --> 00:21:11.244
Man, you're pissing me off.
But what about this?

00:21:11.377 --> 00:21:12.378
A: Get 'em, Koto!
Un: Make 'em hurt!

00:21:16.516 --> 00:21:17.917
Hey, Myoue.

00:21:18.351 --> 00:21:21.487
There's something I've always
wanted to ask you.

00:21:22.488 --> 00:21:25.258
Every time you open your mouth,
it's nothing but complaints.

00:21:25.258 --> 00:21:28.761
But you treat those children
like they're your treasures.

00:21:29.495 --> 00:21:31.664
Nothing is supposed to be
a secret between us...

00:21:32.431 --> 00:21:33.633
Tell me, Myoue.

00:21:33.966 --> 00:21:37.804
Is it your father you miss,
or your mother?

00:21:44.644 --> 00:21:46.445
Take that, toaster!

00:21:48.314 --> 00:21:51.784
Special Move:
Home Appliance Slaughterer!

00:21:52.451 --> 00:21:53.252
Dummy.

00:21:53.252 --> 00:21:54.020
Idiot.

00:21:59.859 --> 00:22:02.395
Hold on a second!
Time out! Time out!

00:22:56.449 --> 00:22:58.517
Maybe it was a waste after all.

00:23:06.826 --> 00:23:08.594
Are you sure about this?

00:23:08.594 --> 00:23:10.897
A: Let me out, let me out, let me out! Un: Let me out,
let me out, let me out! We'll have to see what happens...

00:23:34.687 --> 00:23:35.955
We meet at last!

00:23:38.090 --> 00:23:38.758
Mom!

00:23:47.199 --> 00:23:53.606
I'd even cut things off, (Ouch!)
to prove the fact I exist.

00:23:55.441 --> 00:24:01.547
Though eternal lies surround me,
they're my safety line.

00:24:03.349 --> 00:24:09.956
"Wanna take you high?"
The galaxy shakes. You smile.

00:24:11.524 --> 00:24:17.997
I want to touch you. I don't want
to hear that it's forbidden.

00:24:19.799 --> 00:24:23.469
Moved to emotion by arguments,
| cast aside reason.

00:24:23.469 --> 00:24:28.574
I enter a game of risk that's
devoid of reason.

00:24:31.844 --> 00:24:36.615
It's resplendent with rare pain.

00:24:40.052 --> 00:24:45.124
Mistaking the real for the unreal.

00:24:48.260 --> 00:24:52.131
It transcends all understanding.

00:24:52.131 --> 00:24:53.099
So, fight!

00:24:56.369 --> 00:24:57.236
So, fight!

00:25:00.473 --> 00:25:01.307
So, fight!

00:25:08.514 --> 00:25:09.415
So, fight!

00:25:09.982 --> 00:25:11.951
K'Yy O U S O UG I G A

00:25:12.618 --> 00:25:14.020
I've missed you, everyone!

00:25:14.286 --> 00:25:17.089
Your mom is glad to see
how you've grown up.

00:25:17.723 --> 00:25:20.226
I'm sorry I made you so sad.

00:25:20.926 --> 00:25:23.062
But I'm going back now.

00:25:23.829 --> 00:25:26.465
| can't let that dream come true.

00:25:27.133 --> 00:25:28.934
Right, my love?

00:25:29.635 --> 00:25:34.106
Dal's Badk, Too Next time: "Mom's
Back, and oh, Dad's Back, Too."

00:25:34.840 --> 00:25:38.844
All I want is for our family
to live together, but...
